## Hardware-aware Tile Quantization for NPU GEMM

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。

Hardware-aware tile quantization是一种将fine-grained group quantization的weight layout重新排列以对齐矩阵乘法单元（如HMX）tile-level数据布局的技术。核心思想：先按矩阵单元期望的tile memory order重排权重，再在memory order上做group quantization，使quantization group的连续性与硬件tile的连续性一致。对HMX而言，tile layout为32×32 tile column-major + tile内每2 rows permutation；在此顺序上做group size=32的4-bit量化等价于以2×16 tile片段为量化组。相比conventional column-major group layout需要在runtime做scatter到TCM（开销极大），tile quantization使weight tile可连续写入TCM，无需scatter。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。

Weight preparation和runtime GEMM kernel伪代码：

```
// Offline: Weight transformation + quantization
W = load_hf_weights()                    // shape: [K, N], FP16
W_tile = permute_to_hmx_layout(W)        // tile级column-major + tile内2-row perm
for group g in range(num_groups):
    // group size 32, 在tile memory order上连续
    max_abs = max(abs(W_tile[g*32:(g+1)*32]))
    scale = max_abs / 7.0
    W_q[g*32:(g+1)*32] = round(W_tile[g*32:(g+1)*32] / scale)

// Post-quant: Coalesce 8 groups into super-block
// 8 groups × 32 INT4 = 256 INT4 = 128 bytes = 1 HVX register
// Scales of 8 groups → 8 × FP16 = 16 bytes, contiguous
for super_g in range(num_groups // 8):
    dst_q[super_g*128 : (super_g+1)*128] = concat(groups 0..7 quantized vals)
    dst_s[super_g*16 : (super_g+1)*16] = concat(groups 0..7 scales)

// Runtime: Dequantized GEMM kernel on NPU
// A: activation tile [batch, 32], FP16
// W_q: quantized weights in HMX tile layout
// W_s: scales
for tile_idx in range(num_tiles):
    // 1. DMA: load W_q and W_s tiles into TCM
    dma_load_W(W_q[tile_idx], TCM_addr_W)
    dma_load_A(A_tile, TCM_addr_A)

    // 2. HVX dequantization (vlut16 + LUT scale broadcast)
    for super_g in range(tile_groups):
        W_fp16_sg = vlut16(W_q_int4[super_g], LUT_INT4_TO_FP16)
        // vlut16: 每个8-bit index→16-bit FP16, 256个INT4→512B FP16
        scales = LUT_broadcast(W_s[super_g])
        // LUT内容为4组scales + constant indices, 一次vlut16广播
        W_fp16_sg = W_fp16_sg * scales  // FP16 mul

    // 3. HMX tile-level MM
    for mm_tile in range(sub_tiles):
        hmx_load(W_fp16_tile, A_tile)      // 加载到HMX input buffer
        O_tile += hmx_mma(W_fp16_tile, A_tile)  // FP16 MM, FP32 accumulate
    // HMX可对output tile独立加scale/bias

    // 4. DMA: write O_tile back to DDR
    dma_store(O_tile, DDR_addr_O)
```

相比conventional layout（column-major group quant + runtime scatter到TCM），tile quantization加速9.65-19.04×；相比仅HMX layout不加group coalesce，再加速1.82-3.45×；仅比no dequantization上界慢~27%。

术语一般如何实现？如何使用？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。

实现要点：(1) 离线转换脚本：HuggingFace weight→HMX tile layout GGUF→llama-quantize (Q4_0/Q8_0)；不同NPU的tile layout不同，需为每种硬件定制；(2) 通用性：AMX (Intel)、SME (ARM)等CPU矩阵单元也有类似tile layout需求，核心思想可迁移；(3) Trade-off：tile-group quantization的精度与conventional group quantization几乎相同（论文实测WinoGrande/MMLU/Wiki PPL差异远小于量化本身损失），但layout转换依赖特定硬件知识。开源实现见llama.cpp-npu的GGUF conversion scripts。

